<!-- Teaching layer over the approved Patterns source 4520147. -->
<!-- @opening -->
<p class="story-lead">A user retries a failed search while the first response is still in flight. A late event can arrive after the second request starts. Review the current state and event together before deciding which transition is valid.</p>

<!-- @before 5. Failure Modes & Tradeoffs :: staff -->
### Test the transition and the effect separately

Start with an explicit state and feed the reducer a typed event. Assert the next state. For an effect such as starting a request, also check when the effect runs and how the result comes back as a new event. A pure transition alone does not order concurrent requests. [Android UI state production](https://developer.android.com/topic/architecture/ui-layer/state-production).
